      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787909279496,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "W_O是可训练参数矩阵:\n目的是融合各个Attention信息\n同时也确保O_final和X形状一致",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "W_O是可训练参数矩阵:\n目的是融合各个Attention信息\n同时也确保O_final和X形状一致",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
