    {
      "id": "m5dqHQNB02Dm01K98alxb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1278.7166331266344,
      "y": 5036.40042401479,
      "width": 450.1798095703125,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1510440894,
      "version": 412,
      "versionNonce": 1118424503,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787987124356,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "O_final,也叫O_MHA,为Multi-Head的最终计算结果\n\nX+O_MHA:旧信息+Attention新信息\n1.为了防止原信息丢失\n2.缓解深层网络梯度传播困难,\n让深层transform更容易传播",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "O_final,也叫O_MHA,为Multi-Head的最终计算结果\n\nX+O_MHA:旧信息+Attention新信息\n1.为了防止原信息丢失\n2.缓解深层网络梯度传播困难,\n让深层transform更容易传播",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
