      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Y=LayerNorm(X+O_MHA)\nLayerNorm是对每一个token自己的特征维度做归一化,\n让数值尺度更稳定",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
