      "seed": 7795575,
      "version": 169,
      "versionNonce": 801529815,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787987334436,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "归一化:计算所有值的平均值,\n然后看每一个值到平均值有多远,最后除以标准差",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "归一化:计算所有值的平均值,\n然后看每一个值到平均值有多远,最后除以标准差",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-NBBSMOLIpDEXKpj0ltac",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2808.0047952068326,
      "y": 4833.953281414867,
      "width": 354.95989990234375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 17144919,
      "version": 244,
      "versionNonce": 1663637911,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787987531107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.FFN是每一个Token各算各的\n2.Attention擅长的是token之间的交流,\n而FFN则是每个token内部再消化一遍\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.FFN是每一个Token各算各的\n2.Attention擅长的是token之间的交流,\n而FFN则是每个token内部再消化一遍\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KmIYT93paHtmaeO2DxmwD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2705.7744000996263,
      "y": 4961.323207417092,
      "width": 540.9198608398438,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1361497335,
      "version": 629,
      "versionNonce": 957897559,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787988178940,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "x→xW1​+b1​→ReLU/GELU→W2​+b2​\n1.h=xW1​+b1​(放大维度)\nW1负责放大维度\n\n2.ReLU/GELU (激活函数,重新整合信息)\n(1).ReLU(h)=max(0,h).\n(2).GELU:非线性激活函数,现代transformer常用,不用背公式\n(3).这里的ReLU和GELU是二选一关系\n\n3.o=h′W2​+b2(压缩维度)\nW2负责压缩回原维度\n\n\n4.总:\nFFN(x)=(ReLU/GELU(x(W1+b1)))W2+b2",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "x→xW1​+b1​→ReLU/GELU→W2​+b2​\n1.h=xW1​+b1​(放大维度)\nW1负责放大维度\n\n2.ReLU/GELU (激活函数,重新整合信息)\n(1).ReLU(h)=max(0,h).\n(2).GELU:非线性激活函数,现代transformer常用,不用背公式\n(3).这里的ReLU和GELU是二选一关系\n\n3.o=h′W2​+b2(压缩维度)\nW2负责压缩回原维度\n\n\n4.总:\nFFN(x)=(ReLU/GELU(x(W1+b1)))W2+b2",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
